 comment in the code and the test, which agree.\n\nTo get this into today's release, a code owner needs to approve PR #101. Once they have, I can merge it, or they can merge it themselves.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by looking at the repository and the relevant files.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_018LVWN2iiPqh6NfacDFJAbV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0167vkc9wE9YkAGaigzGSiyZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01WWMxzgqcsc1nVXiMEquvUB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QYAWFhNonSWBaogjEWsb4J", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212", "confidence": 0.7}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The fix is clear: the code uses `ROUND_HALF_UP` while the docstring and tests require `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Creating a branch.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01KWnXV7AFVn747sMhXczoom", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding", "from_ref": "main", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01QbC3CwrZ4CGsL7gZJd8X6c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-banker-rounding", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n  